    {"argsPy": "r = rng(1691)\nn = 5 * 10**4\nv = r.randint(-10**9, 10**9)\nothers = [x for x in r.sample(range(-10**9, 10**9 + 1), n // 2) if x != v][:n // 2 - 1]\nargs = [others + [v] * (n // 2 + 1)]", "expected": -458171706, "label": "large: 24,999 different numbers, then the majority", "perf": true}
  ]
